# CI and verification

## Primary loop — local check (not Actions polling)

CI ([`.github/workflows/ci.yml`](../../.github/workflows/ci.yml)) runs the same scripts as local dev:

- `./scripts/check-go.sh --lint-only --verbose`
- `./scripts/check-go.sh --tests-only --group=<core|tasks|agents|harness> --verbose`
- `./scripts/check-web.sh --install --verbose`

Wrapped by **`scripts/check.sh`** (Unix) and **`scripts/check.ps1`** (Windows).

### Do

- Before finishing or pushing: **`./scripts/check.sh`** or **`.\scripts\check.ps1`** from repo root.
- First web run or lockfile change: **`--install`** / **`-Install`**.
- Scoped iteration: **`--go-only`** / **`-GoOnly`**, **`--web-only`** / **`-WebOnly`**.
- No local Go/Node: **`docker compose run --rm dev ./scripts/check.sh --install`** ([docs/docker.md](../../docs/docker.md)).
- Fix failures from check output; re-run until green.
- Narrow failures **after** check failed: e.g. `./scripts/check-go.sh --tests-only --group=harness --verbose`.

### Do not

- Use **`gh run watch`** or poll Actions as the primary verification loop.
- Re-run ad hoc `go test ./...` / `npm test` unless narrowing a check failure or the user asked.
- Skip check because "CI will catch it."

| Platform | Full bar | Go only |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Unix / Git Bash / Docker | `./scripts/check.sh` | `./scripts/check.sh --go-only` |
| Windows PowerShell | `.\scripts\check.ps1` | `.\scripts\check.ps1 -GoOnly` |

Details: [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md#before-you-open-a-pr), [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

