## Common harness CI failure pattern

Harness tests seed tasks without git binding → worker logs `task missing git binding; deferring pickup` → tasks stuck `ready`. Fix: seed `worktree_id` / `branch_id` on tasks (see `pkgs/tasks/agentreconcile/` test helpers).
